# User preferences

- **Scripts**: Do not ask the user to run scripts. Run any necessary scripts yourself (e.g. build, test, lint, canon pipeline). If a script is required to complete a task, execute it.
- **Commits**: When committing on the user's behalf, do not add a "Co-authored-by" line to the commit message. Use a plain commit message only.
